{
  "_comment": "新增机型模板：改 id/display_name/manifest.file/platform/expect_vermagic 即可。platform 与 build_cmd 请对照该 manifest 分支 README.md 的第一行。",
  "id": "oneplus_XXXX",
  "display_name": "一加 XXX",
  "source_type": "oplus",
  "android_version": "android16",
  "kernel_version": "6.6",
  "sub_level": "118",
  "os_patch_level": "2026-01",
  "platform": "sun",
  "build_method": "perf",
  "build_cmd": "./oplus/build/oplus_build_kernel.sh sun perf",
  "manifest": {
    "repos": [
      "OnePlusOSS/kernel_manifest",
      "Eternal-Dash/kernel_manifest",
      "Numbersf/kernel_manifest"
    ],
    "branch": "oneplus/sm8750",
    "file": "oneplus_XXXX.xml"
  },
  "localversion_mode": "keep",
  "expect_vermagic": "6.6.XXX-android15-8-o-4k",
  "vermagic_strict": false,
  "pack": {
    "mode": "anykernel",
    "block": "boot",
    "do_modules": "0",
    "devicecheck": "0"
  },
  "ksu_variants": [
    "SukiSU",
    "SukiSU(40548)",
    "SukiSU(40726)",
    "BakaSU",
    "Official"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "localversion 必须为 keep：官方 vermagic 带 -o-4k，改了就加载不了厂商模块。",
    "build_method=perf 与官方 README 一致（oplus_build_kernel.sh sun perf）。",
    "刷机方式：AnyKernel3 只替换 boot 里的 Image，不动 init_boot / vendor_boot。",
    "expect_vermagic 用于构建后自检，与 stock 模块 vermagic 不一致时不建议刷入。"
  ],
  "susfs_kmi": "android15"
}
